vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
For drawing 0, explicitly set `newAccumulator = drawingAccumulator[0]` (which is PRECISE_UNIT) before using it in calculations:
```solidity
if (_drawingId > 0) {
    newAccumulator = currentLP.lpPoolTotal == 0 ? PRECISE_UNIT :
        (drawingAccumulator[_drawingId - 1] * postDrawLpValue) / currentLP.lpPoolTotal;
    drawingAccumulator[_drawingId] = newAccumulator;
} else {
    newAccumulator = drawingAccumulator[0]; // Use initialized value
}
```
